    "title": "Used to / Would",
    "title_ko": "Used to / Would (과거 습관)",
    "focus_axis": "grammar"
  },
  "context": {
    "explanation_en": "'Used to' describes past habits and states that are no longer true: 'I used to live in Busan.' 'Would' also describes repeated past actions, but NOT states (you can't say 'I would live in Busan'): 'When I was a kid, I would visit my grandmother every summer.'",
    "explanation_ko": "'used to'는 지금은 사실이 아닌 과거의 습관·상태를 나타냅니다: 'I used to live in Busan.' 'would'도 반복된 과거 행동을 나타내지만 상태에는 못 씁니다('I would live in Busan'은 틀림): 'When I was a kid, I would visit my grandmother every summer.'",
    "key_expressions": [
      {
        "en": "I used to play soccer every weekend.",
        "ko": "저는 예전에 주말마다 축구를 했어요."
      },
      {
        "en": "We would stay up late talking.",
        "ko": "우리는 늦게까지 이야기하곤 했어요."
      },
      {
        "en": "I didn't use to like coffee.",
        "ko": "저는 예전에 커피를 안 좋아했어요."
      }
    ]
  },
